        role: 0
  - id: bunk_quiet
    title: THE BUNK IS QUIET
    body: The others walk past it. Nobody stops. The log has a line for the name.
      The line is the only thing in the bunk now.
    causeLine: The sealed door has not opened.
    conditions:
    - kind: 2
      tag: 0
