  - id: reactor_strain
    title: THE REACTOR STRAINS
    body: The gauge is in the red. The engineer says it is fine. The gauge disagrees.
      Opening the core would vent the heat. It would also vent the shielding.
    causeLine: The core has been running hot for two days.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 0
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 2
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: OPEN THE CORE
      result: The heat vents. The gauge drops. The shielding goes with it.
      survival: 2
      science: 1
      morale: -2
      setFlag: reactor_open
      requirements:
      - kind: 2
        tag: 0
        role: 0
        flag: oskar_vented
        stat: 0
        value: 0
      lockHint: NO VENT REPORT
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: RUN IT COLD
      result: The gauge holds. The output drops. The lights dim.
      survival: 0
      science: -1
      morale: 1
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: seed_count
    title: THE SEED COUNT
    body: She has a number. The number is smaller than yesterday. The seeds are in
      a locker with a lock nobody has the key to. She has the key. She is not using
      it.
    causeLine: The farmer has been counting the seeds.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 8
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 2
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: SAVE THE SEED
      result: The locker stays locked. The number stays the same. Dinner is smaller.
      survival: 1
      science: 1
      morale: -1
      setFlag: seed_saved
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: EAT IT
      result: The lock opens. Dinner is bigger. The number drops.
      survival: 1
      science: 0
      morale: 0
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: soldier_round
    title: ROUNDS AT NIGHT
    body: The soldier has been checking the airlock. He has also been checking the
      crew. He does not say which he trusts less. The rounds are not in the log.
    causeLine: Someone is walking the corridor at night.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 4
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 3
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
