  - id: end_no_voice
    title: NO VOICE
    body: The crew stops talking. The log stops being written. The ship runs. The
      lights are on. The seats are filled. Nobody is in them. The ship is doing fine.
      The ship is doing fine.
    priority: 100
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
