  - id: end_order
    title: ORDER
    body: The orders stand. The rounds are counted. The crew obeys without being
      asked. The log is full. The log is clean. The ship runs on time. Nobody remembers
      who wrote the first order. It does not matter. The order is the ship now.
    priority: 72
    minSurvival: 5
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
