  - id: end_reactor_priest
    title: THE REACTOR PRIEST
    body: The core is open. The shielding is gone. The engineer who opened it is
      still in the room. The room is warm. The ship is warm. The crew does not go
      near the room. The log says the reactor is fine. The log is written by the
      reactor now.
    priority: 70
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 6
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags:
