    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 00000000
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_mapped
    title: THE MAP WAS RIGHT
    body: The rivers are there. The map was old, not wrong. The dreamer is not surprised.
      The ship follows the rivers. The rivers are not water. The rivers are something
      else. The log has a new entry. The entry is a drawing.
    priority: 65
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 5
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags:
    - map_followed
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 06000000
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_clean_air
    title: CLEAN AIR
    body: The bunk is sealed. The sick man is gone. The air is clean. The crew breathes
      without thinking about it. The log has a name in it. The name is the only thing
      in the bunk. The air is very clean.
    priority: 60
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags:
    - bunk_sealed
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 07000000
  - id: end_all_high
    title: ALL HANDS
    body: The numbers are good. The crew is fed. The lab is warm. The log is full.
      The ship is not dying. It is not living either. It is holding. The crew calls
      this a victory. The log does not use that word.
    priority: 50
    minSurvival: 7
    minScience: 7
    minMorale: 7
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_lab
    title: THE LAB
    body: The science station is the warmest room on the ship. The crew does not
      go in. The samples are labeled. The labels are correct. The lab runs all night.
      The crew sleeps. The ship is a laboratory now. The laboratory is doing fine.
    priority: 50
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 7
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 6
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 6
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_choir
    title: THE CHOIR
    body: The crew sings. Nobody knows when it started. The log has a line for it.
      The line is a note. The note is not in any of the manuals. The ship runs. The
      crew sings. The singing is not a celebration. It is a habit.
    priority: 50
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 7
    maxSurvival: 6
    maxScience: 6
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_hold
    title: HOLD
    body: The ship holds. The numbers are good. The crew is fed. The log is clean.
      The ship does not move. It holds. The holding is the whole plan. The plan is
      working. The log says so. The log is written by the captain. The captain is
      holding too.
    priority: 50
    minSurvival: 7
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 6
    maxMorale: 6
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
    requiredTags: 
    forbiddenTags: 
  - id: end_drift
    title: DRIFT
    body: The ship drifts. The numbers are not good or bad. The crew is not happy
      or sad. The log has entries. The entries are short. The ship is still going.
      Nobody knows where. The drift is not a failure. It is not a success. It is
      a drift.
    priority: 0
    minSurvival: 0
    minScience: 0
    minMorale: 0
    maxSurvival: 10
    maxScience: 10
    maxMorale: 10
    requiredFlags: []
    forbiddenFlags: []
